Z||000007||Will||06-06-2001||12:43 PM||||Corvette LT1: 300 HP, 330 ftlbs<BR>F-body LT1: 275 HP, 330 ftlbs<BR>Impala SS/Caprice LT1 (iron heads): 260 HP, 330ftlbs. <BR>Corvette LT4: 330 HP rated (closer to 350 actual), 330+ ftlbs<P>Iron LT1 heads flow better than Corvette aluminum LT1 heads, and about on par with LT4 heads.<P>The Fiero is a lot lighter than any of the cars in which the LT1 was originally used.||||reg||1
